        "date": "2026-11-27T20:31:26Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): Holders page imports and exports holder files\n\nImport… and Export… on the Holders page are enabled. Export writes the\ndocument's user holders to a camcraft-components/1 file. Import adds the\nholders of such a file as user holders in one undo step (ImportHolders);\na held id takes a new user:holder:<name> id, as Copy as user holder\ndoes. A file that is not correct, or a row that is not a holder, is\nrefused by name and the document does not change. The MCP tools\nexport_holders and import_holders use the same command.\n\nFixes #4389\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
