        "name": "Quintin Smits",
        "email": "qd.smits@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-28T00:58:55Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(app): import_holders refuses an unreadable library; pin degenerate outlines\n\nThe MCP import_holders tool no longer falls back to the built-in ids when\nthe component library cannot be read. It refuses the import by name, so a\nnew id cannot equal a library id without a diagnostic.\n\nThe degenerate-input test now pins two holder outlines: a negative radius\nand fewer than 3 points. Each is refused by name and nothing is applied.\n\nRefs #4389\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
